\frametitle{Florida murderers (Simpson again)}
\small
Sentences in 4863 murder cases in Florida (1973--78)
\begin{center}
\begin{tabular}{lcc} \hline
&\multicolumn{2}{c}{Sentence}\\
\cline{2-3}
Murderer&Death&Other\\
\hline Black&59&2547\\ White&72&2185\\
\hline
\end{tabular}
\end{center}
The table shows a greater proportion of \emph{white} murderers receiving death sentence than black (3.2\% vs.\ 2.3\%).
\begin{lstlisting}[language=R,basicstyle=\ttfamily\small]
flor <- matrix(c(59,72,2547,2185),2,2)
dimnames(flor) <- list(Murderer=c("Black","White"),
                       Sentence=c("Death","Other"))
chisq.test(flor)$p.value
\end{lstlisting}
